een intense since the Demo launched. Based on your feedback, we fixed a batch of bugs, smoothed out a number of feel issues, and brought the game to more platforms: it now runs on Windows, macOS, and Linux. With most of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4051320-1829528821307060","game_id":"steam-4051320","kind":"announcement","title":"Cap 'n Barr's Adventure Demo Officially Released!","summary":"Hello, fellow gamers!I’m Omega-Ariston, the creator of the indie game Cap 'n Barr's Adventure.It’s been a full year since we officially started development! On this special occasion, we have finally released the Demo version! 🎉We are also very happy to announce that our team has welcomed a new member—the game-loving music producer Funkey has officially joined! Funkey previously worked on GBA game music, and in the future he will compose soundtrack that perfectly matches the retro and joyful atmo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T15:16:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821307060","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4051320-1816215235355334","game_id":"steam-4051320","kind":"announcement","title":"A Letter to Fellow Gamers","summary":"Hello, fellow gamers! I’m Omega-Ariston, the creator of the indie game *Cap 'n Barr's Adventure*. From the art style, you can tell at a glance that we're paying homage to the NES games that were all the rage in our childhood (for some players, it might be consoles like Pegasus, Micro Genius or 300-in-1 game discs). The gameplay mechanics also blend the essence of multiple classic retro games. So, why make a game like this? On one hand, every gamer probably harbors a dream of making their own gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-12T15:49:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816215235355334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4051320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4051320":"2026-10-26T11:23:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4051320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:08Z"},"4567470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:09Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4051320","app_id":4051320,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b385bc350e0dfc4c5a3e4597fe8466d491ccea40311169651194572fb766c608","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"캡과 바의 모험은 게임성이 풍부한 레트로 2D 플랫폼 액션 게임입니다. 귀여운 카피바라, 칩튠 음악, 도전적인 스테이지. 싱글 플레이 또는 로컬 2인 협동을 지원합니다. 플랫포머, 유머, 숨겨진 스테이지를 좋아한다면——한번 플레이해 보세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Ariston Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Omega-Ariston"},{"name":"Ten"},{"name":"Funkey"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Next Fest: 2 Player Games (English)","trailer_